  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dissemination Water Study Kenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In March 2017, a water survey was finalised for the Dutch Embassy in Nairobi. (See project MAV16KE02). This survey gives several interesting new insights into the needs in the Kenyan water market and how to fulfil these with the offerings of the Netherlands. Also, the report determines opportunities, tackles bottlenecks for the Dutch water sector, and identifies concrete steps for a coherent approach to serve identified demand. These are relevant insights and lessons to share and discuss with the Dutch water sector, and it is essential to get the sector actively involved.</narrative>
  </description>
